= Paul Levi

A lawyer and Luxemburg's close ally. Cool-headed and organised, he wants a disciplined party that can win the majority of workers.

- @organise
- @funds
- @root: Return to main

@organise
title: Organise the Apparatus
subtitle: Raises the loyalty of the three least loyal districts.
unavailable-subtitle: [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before the next advisor action.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.advisor_action_timer = 4;
Q.last_advisor_action = 1;
var sorted = Q.districts.slice().sort(function(a, b) {
    return Q['district_' + a + '_loyalty'] - Q['district_' + b + '_loyalty'];
});
for (var i = 0; i < 3; i++) {
    Q['district_' + sorted[i] + '_loyalty'] += 12;
}
!}

Levi builds a network of district secretaries who answer to the Zentrale.

@funds
title: Put the Finances in Order
subtitle: 2 funds.
unavailable-subtitle: [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before the next advisor action.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 4; last_advisor_action = 1; resources += 2

Dues are collected, debts are chased, and the accounts are balanced.
